S3 local evidence at 239b914ab: pinned nightly-2026-03-03, locked dependencies,
12 typed-view tests and five schema tests passed. S2 local evidence at 46744e186
included 37 recovery tests and 11 recognition tests, but two interrupted resource
tests were not passes. The renewed resource investigation is part of this gate.
S5 must recertify the corrected S2-S4 heads, including actual accessor calls,
semantic meaning, operation contracts, activation/results where executable, and
slot-shape hints. S6 requires completed full integration CI; the final accumulated
S7 candidate also requires completed full integration coverage. Pending, skipped,
old-head and zero-test runs are not passing qualification evidence.

Execution boundary under review:

- Outer canonical definitions and expressions are collected in source order.
  Artifact construction additionally requires executable initializers and
  authoritative contracts for every emitted operation.
- Deferred state initializers are represented but rejected at artifact build;
  unresolved/custom operation contracts are also rejected there. Structured
  source forms are not executable merely because their graph or hash exists.
- Seventeen document-unit kinds currently report unsupported-document-unit:
  activation scopes, context declarations/sends, enums, exports, FSM declaration/
  specification/implementation units, functions, invariants, imports, kind
  definitions, module imports, compound assignments, tuple destructuring, and
  assignments. Their syntax/typed coverage does not establish engine execution.
- Display-only inline Mech and Mika-local sections are excluded from outer
  execution collection. Their exclusion does not implement child-scope execution.
  Function or Mika-local bodies must never be flattened into the outer scope.

These boundaries require explicit review against S0-S7 obligations before a
completion claim. They are not automatically deferred to S8. The reserved S8
work remains production consumer replacement and removal of Nom, the remaining
legacy lowering tree, and the old source path. The pre-cutover census must still
account for 29 production calls; no product caller switches during this pass.
